Significant changes from the upstream E2B CLI:

  - Renamed npm package: `@e2b/cli` → `@grotte/cli`
  - Renamed binary: `e2b` → `grotte`
  - Default API endpoint switched to https://api.grotte.parallactic.fr
  - Credentials moved to `~/.grotte/config.json`
  - Added `grotte auth login --key grt_…` flag (was browser-only)
  - Template config files renamed: `e2b.toml` → `grotte.toml`,
    `e2b.Dockerfile` → `grotte.Dockerfile`
  - Brand-string substitutions throughout user-facing output

Source: https://github.com/Jesiel-dev-creator/grotte-sdk
Upstream: https://github.com/e2b-dev/E2B
